<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-United Tractors says H1 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-United Tractors says H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  46.5	  vs	 32.1</p>
<p>    Sales		    1,275.9	  vs	907.4</p>
<p>    EPS (rupiah)		337	   vs	 232</p>
<p>    Gross profit	     217.3	  vs	147.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 121.0	  vs	 76.3</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT United Tractors is engaged in the assembly and distribution of heavy equipment.</p>
